[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2029431027","pull_request_review_id":2744099073,"id":2029431027,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc549qjz","diff_hunk":"@@ -1708,6 +1708,15 @@ void CodeEdit::fold_line(int p_line) {\n \t\t\t\t\tend_line = i;\n \t\t\t\t}\n \t\t\t}\n+\t\t\tif (in_comment != -1) {\n+\t\t\t\tfor (int i = p_line + 1; i < get_line_count(); i++) {\n+\t\t\t\t\tif (is_line_code_region_start(i) || is_line_code_region_end(i)) {\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t// A code region tag should split a comment block, ending it early.\n+\t\t\t\t\t\tend_line = MIN(end_line, i - 1);\n+\t\t\t\t\t\tbreak;\n+\t\t\t\t\t}\n+\t\t\t\t}\n+\t\t\t}","path":"scene/gui/code_edit.cpp","commit_id":"40b7931279936f220088785145dc2cd3a4dcb04b","original_commit_id":"a8019444d7702787175e62dc12633c33d8a7c7b0","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This should be in the `end_line == p_line` check, so that multiline comments (like /* */ in the shader editor) can still hide regions.\r\n\r\nAnd then it can be merged with previous loop, something like this can be added before `end_line = i;`:\r\n```cpp\r\n